{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1017217-artifact-creation","id":1017217,"title":"Artifact creation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-14T12:42:29-08:00","id":1017217,"title":"Artifact creation","content":"Hey all,<br /> <br /> I'll be running my first proper game of awakening in the new year and I've started getting rough character concepts and ideas from my players. One of them is something of a full metal alchemist fan and just so happens to wanna play a one armed Moros with an artifact arm...<br /> <br /> They're really enthusiastic about playing Mage for the first time so I wanna kinda role with it. He's allocated up to five of his starting dots for the artifact, how would you cost an artifact that also acts as a fully functional advanced prosthetic? <br /> <br /> Would it be possible for a Mage to return from their awakening/supernal journey with such an artifact?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/865-welshboi","name":"WelshBoi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-14T12:49:46-08:00","id":1017227,"title":"","content":"The arm is basically under a permanent Golem effect so build it with those effects in mind and cost it like that, and yeah you could receive that as part of your Awakening. Heck, in 1e there was a guy who had his blood turned into an artifact when he Awoke.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2632,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","user":"Mrmdubois","date":". 12-14-2016, 03:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-14T17:34:15-08:00","id":1017396,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1017217-artifact-creation?p=1017227#post1017227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The arm is basically under a permanent Golem effect so build it with those effects in mind and cost it like that, and yeah you could receive that as part of your Awakening. Heck, in 1e there was a guy who had his blood turned into an artifact when he Awoke.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What could his blood do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8573-zombiecakes","name":"Zombiecakes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-14T17:49:51-08:00","id":1017405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zombiecakes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1017217-artifact-creation?p=1017396#post1017396\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> What could his blood do?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Awakened Enzyme counted as a regular Artifact that's part of Allan Holmes's body (and therefore effectively adds its Mana pool to his at all times), as well as allowing him to use Body Control and Honing the Form on himself as reflexive actions. It's also sufficiently weird that it's speculated to be capable of other effects related to the Life Arcanum as a supposed &quot;dynamic Artifact.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's in Keys to the Supernal Tarot, filed under &quot;The Sun.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-15T14:22:11-08:00","id":1017794,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1017217-artifact-creation?p=1017405#post1017405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Awakened Enzyme counted as a regular Artifact that's part of Allan Holmes's body (and therefore effectively adds its Mana pool to his at all times), as well as allowing him to use Body Control and Honing the Form on himself as reflexive actions. It's also sufficiently weird that it's speculated to be capable of other effects related to the Life Arcanum as a supposed &quot;dynamic Artifact.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's in Keys to the Supernal Tarot, filed under &quot;The Sun.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Now I remember it. I really did like KtST as a piece of fluff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8573-zombiecakes","name":"Zombiecakes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}